# Frigate publishes state and accepts control messages below its own prefix.
user frigate
topic readwrite frigate/#

# Home Assistant is the automation hub and may later host other MQTT devices.
user homeassistant
topic readwrite #

# ESPresense nodes and Companion share measurements and fleet settings below
# espresense/#. Nodes also publish Home Assistant MQTT discovery documents.
user espresense
topic readwrite espresense/#
topic write homeassistant/#
topic read homeassistant/status

# The container health check only needs a broker-owned status topic.
user healthcheck
topic read $SYS/broker/uptime
